%% Figure 4.11 – State Machine Diagram: payment_request.status (VietQR collection) · v3.2 · 05/11/2026 · Register v1.4
%% Same content as CrabShare_State_Machines.drawio, page "payment_request.status" (generated by gen-state.js, do not edit by hand).
%% «planned» = Register v1.4, not in code (class planned, grey dashed) · (not written by code) = CHECK value never written (class notwritten, orange dashed).
%% Labels are short (trigger [guard] / effect); the full label of each transition is in the %% line under it.
%% Design decisions of 05/11/2026 applied here were confirmed by the lead.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending : / create VietQR · UC12
  %% / created by a payment request: VietQR via the payment intermediary, reference code, expires_at · UC12 «planned» PreOrderBalance = weighedKg × price per kg − deposit, issued at delivery
  Pending --> Paid : webhook [new txn, amount matches] / Matched · UC12
  %% webhook [provider_txn_id new, amount matches, before expires_at] / transaction Matched, purpose handler · UC12
  Pending --> Expired : after(expires_at) or late webhook / refund late money · UC12
  %% after(expires_at) (funding close / reservation expiry jobs) or late webhook / late money → Refund instruction · UC12
  Pending --> Cancelled : contribution or order cancelled, batch Cancelled · UC10, UC54, UC55
  %% contribution or order cancelled, or batch Cancelled · UC10, UC54, UC55 «planned» a pending balance request is cancelled when the order is forfeited
  Paid --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
  note right of Pending
    «planned» on start → Pending - PreOrderBalance = weighedKg × price per kg − deposit, issued at delivery
    «planned» precondition of start → Pending - OrderPayment is reused by invoiced sales and the final order instead of retail checkout
    «planned» on Pending → Cancelled - a pending balance request is cancelled when the order is forfeited
  end note
  %% Created by a payment request only if: purpose Contribution, PreOrderDeposit, PreOrderBalance or OrderPayment (OfftakeDeposit and OfftakePayment are removed in v1.4); «planned» OrderPayment is reused by invoiced sales and the final order instead of retail checkout (UC12).
  %% Idempotency: provider_txn_id is UNIQUE; a repeated webhook is acknowledged without a second booking (TL-10). An amount mismatch keeps the request Pending and books the transaction Unmatched for manual reconciliation (UC40).
  %% Purposes OfftakeDeposit and OfftakePayment are removed in v1.4 (still in code and in ck_payment_request_purpose), so they are not drawn; OrderPayment stays, reused by invoiced sales (Figure 4.18) instead of retail checkout. Gap: no job expires PreOrderBalance requests (due after 48 h); only a late webhook moves them to Expired.
  classDef planned stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#64748b,color:#64748b,fill:#f8fafc
  classDef notwritten stroke-dasharray:5 5,stroke:#9a3412,fill:#f1f5f9
  classDef terminal fill:#f1f5f9,stroke:#64748b
  class Paid, Expired, Cancelled terminal
